{
 "encounter_id": "00695",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CLINICAL_STAFF"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Mr Chandra, I've put your driving licence details on the system, the doctor will ask about that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you. I am a taxi driver, so this matters very much. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good morning, Mr Chandra. Tell me what's been happening. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, I have strange episodes. I get a feeling of déjà vu, like I have lived this moment before. It lasts a minute, maybe two."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How often does that happen?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four or five times, since January. Last week, twice."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does anything come with it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A smell. Like burning toast, but there is no toast. It comes right before the feeling."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And during the episode, are you aware of what's going on around you?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Partly. I am staring, my wife says. I do not answer her for a minute or so. And I feel confused, a bit, afterwards."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you ever lost consciousness, or collapsed?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. I did not fall. I always stayed on my feet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any biting your tongue, or wetting yourself?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. None of that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any headache after, or a head injury before this started?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No headache. No injury."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What about your health in general?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure for ten years, and I had meningitis as a boy, at nine years old."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Interesting, that's relevant. And your medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Amlodipine, 5 mg once a day, and atorvastatin, 20 mg at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Who do you live with, and how many hours do you drive?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I live with my wife and daughter. And I drive twelve hours a day, six days a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll look at your reflexes and balance. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Of course.",
   "pause": 25.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your coordination, strength and reflexes are normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So what is it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Brief episodes with a smell beforehand, déjà vu, staring and confusion afterwards, they sound like focal seizures from the temporal lobe."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Seizures? Epilepsy? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I can't confirm that without tests. I'd like to arrange an EEG, a brainwave recording, and an MRI scan of your brain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll book them both for the coming weeks, Mr Chandra. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The important thing is driving. Until you've seen the neurologist, I'm advising you not to drive."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, it is my living. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I know. I'm sorry. The rules are firm, and it protects you and your passengers. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I can give you the DVLA leaflet and our letter for your insurance, if it helps. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you. Yes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If you have another episode, or any collapse, don't wait, come in or go to the emergency department."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I understand. ~"
  }
 ],
